WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.150
Standing medium punch begins the near-corner target.

2
00:00:01.150 --> 00:00:01.750
The heavy-punch continuation cancels into Sprint.

3
00:00:01.750 --> 00:00:02.500
Sprint slide knocks Ryu down near the wall.

4
00:00:02.500 --> 00:00:03.500
The actual yellow-punch plant command places one medium bomb and the can counter reads two.

5
00:00:03.500 --> 00:00:04.350
Ryu rises beside the planted bomb.

6
00:00:04.350 --> 00:00:04.430
The planted bomb detonates automatically as Ryu rises.
